### 포인트 예약 요청 (Happy Path 예시)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/points/reserve
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "pointNumber": "PNT-INT-AVAILABLE-001",
  "orderId": "ORD-12345"
}

###

### 포인트 확정 요청 (RESERVED -> USED)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/points/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "pointNumber": "PNT-INT-AVAILABLE-001",
  "orderId": "ORD-12345"
}

###

### 포인트 보상 요청 (RESERVED -> AVAILABLE)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/points/compensate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "pointNumber": "PNT-INT-AVAILABLE-001",
  "orderId": "ORD-12345"
}

###

# (선택) 서버 헬스 체크
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health
Accept: application/json
